                  "text": "36:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau wakaya kuli-Ismayeli, waakukwata Mahalati mwana musimbi wa-Ismayeli mwana wa-Abrahamu, mucizi waNebayoti, waalikila banakazi mbaakakwete kale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
