        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakalota. Muciloto cakwe wakabona itantilo liimvwi ansi, ampela yalyo yakasika kujulu, nkabela baangelo ba-Leza bakali kuya butanta akuseluka alindilyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.12",
