        },
        {
          "text": "Alakwe Jehova wakaliimvwi atala alyo, nkabela wakati, Ndime Jehova, Leza wa-Abrahamu uso, a-Leza wa-Izaka. Nyika eyi mpolede alinjiyo, ndaipa nduwe alunyungu lwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
