        {
          "text": "Nkabela lunyungu lwako luyoovula mbuli bulongo bwaansi, luyoomwaala kumbo akujwe akunyika akumusanza, alimwi mulinduwe amulunyungu lwako inzubo zyoonse zyanyika moziyoojana coolwe. ",
